---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import LegalPageShell from "@/components/LegalPageShell.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="Terms for using SeenTube, a product of Arigato Labs."
>
  <LegalPageShell
    title="Terms & Conditions"
    lead="Rules for using SeenTube."
    updated="August 2026"
  >
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2>1. Agreement</h2>
      <p>By using <strong>SeenTube</strong>, you agree to these terms and our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2>2. The service</h2>
      <p>
        SeenTube is provided by <strong>Arigato Labs</strong> to help you organize YouTube videos,
        track progress, connect with accepted contacts, and build learning roadmaps.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2>3. Accounts</h2>
      <p>
        You are responsible for your Google login, username, and the content you add
        (videos, tags, roadmaps, messages in contact forms, and connection activity).
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2>4. Acceptable use</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Do not abuse, spam, or attempt to break authentication or security controls.</li>
        <li>Do not scrape or overload the service in a way that harms other users.</li>
        <li>Do not upload or share illegal content, or use SeenTube to harass others.</li>
        <li>Respect connection and visibility settings — do not try to access private data that is not yours.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2>5. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The <strong>Arigato Labs</strong> name, logos, and brand assets are owned by Arigato Labs.
        SeenTube product UI and code are owned by Arigato Labs unless a project README states otherwise.
        YouTube videos and metadata belong to their respective owners; SeenTube only stores links and details you choose to save.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2>6. Availability</h2>
      <p>
        The service may change, break, or stop without notice. We do not guarantee uptime,
        uninterrupted access, or that every feature will remain available forever.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2>7. Termination</h2>
      <p>
        We may suspend or limit access for abuse or security risk. You may stop using SeenTube at any time.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2>8. Governing note</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are interpreted under applicable law in India, unless Arigato Labs later publishes a different jurisdiction.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2>9. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        <a href="mailto:kumardevanshu3001@gmail.com">kumardevanshu3001@gmail.com</a>
        · <a href="/contact">Contact form</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </LegalPageShell>
</Layout>
